          ['Kirilyuk V. S., Levchuk O. I., Kobzar P. Yu., Witer M. B. Mathematical Modeling of Displacement of Rigid Elliptic Disc in Piezoelectric Space. International Applied Mechanics, 2024, vol. 60, no. 6, pp. 37–44.', 'https://doi.org/10.1007/s10778-024-01294-6'],
